{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0034_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d666116b9e3fc6194accdafb8d0136b4ed21fa4d06b68b6d3bc352c0c59b2e0c", "ja": "貴音、お疲れさま。またその衣装のチェックか。\nずいぶん念入りなんだな。", "zh": "贵音，辛苦了。你又在检查那套服装啊，\n真是用心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0034_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "2e98badca8717f209de4f7d50f6451e24c677bd9a6b3eb8b1b90e7646a2e6c04", "ja": "これは……、その、申し訳ありません。\n衣装の確認というのは、ただの口実……。", "zh": "这是……那个，不好意思。\n说要检查服装只是借口……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0034_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "5f6cfa31e170148610519486a8af8fc887e15f5a5f1a87319d09589904f0bf27", "ja": "実際のところ、私は……ただ着てみたいだけなのです。\nどうか、お許しください。", "zh": "其实，小女子只是……单纯想穿穿看而已。\n还请多见谅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0034_1004_p", "source_sha256": "10f7edeaf6865ca4fbb8ebec697f9da19eff14fa523f12018e4c3002b35437cf", "ja": "はは、そういうことなら、いくらでも着てくれていい。\nその方が衣装も喜ぶだろうしな。", "zh": "哈哈，既然是这样，那你就尽量穿吧。\n这样服装也会比较开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0034_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "723c43200064d5eea098134228085502af124b190bd0f4337cccb435fa55f722", "ja": "まあ、衣装がですか……？\nふふっ、そうであれば、私も嬉しいのですが。", "zh": "哎呀，服装会很开心吗……？\n呵呵，若是如此，那小女子也会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0034_1006_p", "source_sha256": "292294e9a18f3e8f2e44f0ce2d9ce1a28f356debb5b1cc202b3ba8898d4e79d1", "ja": "それにしても、本当によく似合ってるな。ブログも\n読んだけど、貴音に喜んでもらえたみたいで何よりだ。", "zh": "话说回来，这套服装真的很适合你呢。我也有看\n贵音的部落格，看来这似乎让你很开心，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0034_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "abb85661b5a271097ab1a05d83b3b274425ceed699a6c99417fa9d9039d4bd91", "ja": "はい。この衣装に身を包んで、ファンの皆様の前に\n立てることを、この上なく幸せに思います……。", "zh": "是的，能穿着这套服装站在粉丝们面前，\n小女子确实感到了无与伦比的幸福……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0034_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "c00e60189071a575dfce4662246d5e6be94a2110972aec805571a5473f5ac8aa", "ja": "これほど素晴らしき衣装を頂いたからには、\n私も……応えなくてはなりませんね。", "zh": "既然收到了这么棒的服装，\n小女子也……必须有所回应才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0034_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "dec8d47f68348f7a7696ae57f25cd11ce572a7329bce56e4d2fc0c8219f6ed6c", "ja": "見ていてください、{$P$}。\n私はいつか必ず、たどり着いてみせます。", "zh": "请不要让眼光离开小女子，{$P$}。\n总有一天小女子也一定会抵达的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0034_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "915942a0a7612b16027291c3b1de9dbc2d106570135c31a4133226543aaae8c8", "ja": "遥かな高み、トップアイドルの座に……。", "zh": "抵达那位于遥远高处的，顶尖偶像之座……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0034_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2974d68537561d6270bf178d067f3e1334b90db9b8bf097c637f35063b417235", "ja": "なら、俺もその決意に応えるまでだな。\nいつか貴音を、その座にたどり着かせることで。", "zh": "那我要做的就是回应你的决心了。\n总有一天，我会让贵音坐上那个位置的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0034_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "a7ab74787c72279f039772d5cd030932a19ca9f42d6859aaccb71ee7cad54c9d", "ja": "互いの気持ちに応え合うことで、高め合う……。\nそうですね。そういうものでしたね。", "zh": "互相回应彼此的心情，并借此相互砥砺……\n也是，本来就该这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
